{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 皆さんおはようございます!\n 佐藤詩織です۬৺۬☆\n \n \n 最近一眼レフやっと買いました!\n \n \n 作品ちょっとだけ見せます!!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 夜のバス停。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB03D973DTHKAJKJ5Y72MQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 一台。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB04DPBR33X76C4P56GVQ6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n 二台。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB05DYPYV0TCNFZ8RXB3EP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n タクシーがどんどん増えてく。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そして居なくなったタクシー停留所。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB06CZVF543NFDT0R8SR1Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n なんだかサーキット場みたい。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n タクシー増えるにつれ、\n 撮り方変えてみました!\n \n \n \n \n 絵だけじゃなく、写真も極めたい。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB07CVSQD1A876MM2SFMJM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n わざとピント ぼかしてみたら綺麗。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB08CCW1T4RK3ZD26NBMNB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n この先はどんなところに繋がってるんだろう。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n まだまだ ぺーぺーなので、\n \n 極めたい。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n それじゃ!\n \n \n \n \n \n 詩織**"}],"source":"archive"}